@startuml Implementation_View
title Smart E-Mobility Hub — Development View (Submission 3)
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 105
skinparam ranksep 115
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

package "Presentation" #E0F2FE {
  component "Student Portal" as StudentUI #E8F7FF
  component "Operator Portal" as OperatorUI #E8F7FF
}

package "Application" #F3F4F6 {
  component "API handlers\nsession / role / source checks" as API #FFFFFF
  component "Internal scheduler\nstart eligibility / expiry / timeout / health" as Scheduler #FFFFFF
}

package "Domain modules" as Domain #EAF7EA {
  component "Hub & Identity" as Hub #D9EFD9
  component "Vehicle Rental" as Rental #D9EFD9
  component "Parking & Private EV" as Parking #D9EFD9
  component "Fleet & Incident\ntelemetry intake" as Fleet #D9EFD9
  component "Smart Charging\nFCFS waitlist" as Charging #D9EFD9
  component "What-if Simulation\ncopy-only" as Simulation #D9EFD9
}

package "Shared layer" as Shared #FFF4D6 {
  component "Repository + Unit of Work\ncommand/event ledger" as Repository #FFF9E8
  component "Versioned snapshot contract" as Snapshot #FFF9E8
  component "JSON seed / in-memory adapter\nstate lock + audit" as Adapter #FFF9E8
}

StudentUI ..> API : Student actions
OperatorUI ..> API : Operator actions
API ..> Domain
Scheduler ..> Domain
Domain ..> Repository
Simulation ..> Snapshot : read and copy
Repository ..> Adapter : atomic commit
Snapshot ..> Adapter : consistent read

StudentUI -[hidden]right- OperatorUI
API -[hidden]right- Scheduler
Hub -[hidden]right- Rental
Rental -[hidden]right- Parking
Fleet -[hidden]right- Charging
Charging -[hidden]right- Simulation
Rental -[hidden]down- Fleet
Parking -[hidden]down- Charging
Repository -[hidden]right- Snapshot
Repository -[hidden]down- Adapter
Snapshot -[hidden]down- Adapter
Domain -[hidden]right- Shared
@enduml
